      "children": []
    },
    {
      "heading": "Why not \"just Claude Code\"",
      "points": [
        {
          "text": "And you're not \"worse\" — agentic AI is no longer a single-tool field, there are open alternatives.",
          "origin": "extract"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "heading": "What \"stack\" means here",
      "points": [
        {
          "text": "For example: Claude Code → LiteLLM → Cerebras gpt-oss-120b — Claude Code UI with an open model Aider → direct OpenRouter → DeepSeek model — classic OSS workflow Hermes → LiteLLM with a fallback chain — an example of an owner-controlled stack",
          "origin": "extract"
        },
        {
          "text": "This module teaches you to think about the whole stack rather than \"knowing one tool\".",
          "origin": "extract"
